  "details": "Description\n\nAnytime vrchat logs me out, I turn into an error bot all the time. I always have to delete the app for it not to turn me into an error bot. Everyone is an error bot.\n\nReproduction Steps\n\nI have no clue, it only happens if the game manually logs me out. The only way to get rid of it is to delete the app.\n\nDetails\n\n- Category: Other\n\n- Frequency: Often\n\n---\n\nplatform: Quest (platform: Android - Quest, store: Oculus, headset: None)\n\nrawPlatform: Android\n\nclientVersion: 2026.4.1p1-1937-299983b13b-Release\n\nunityVersion: 6000.0.67f1-DWR\n\nIn-Client Report\n\n---\n\n**Log file:** [output_log_2026-11-08_23-45-40.txt](https://api.vrchat.cloud/api/1/file/file_4e0e2feb-8775-4fe9-8ae1-e4d668b8e426/1/file)",
